From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anxelok <anxelok@localhost>
Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 15:22:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Restore legacy Paper plugin compatibility surface

NMS plugins (FastAsyncWorldEdit and others) link directly against
MinecraftServer.currentTick and the Level mutation-capture fields that
patches 0002 and 0061 removed, failing with NoSuchFieldError. Restore
them as a compatibility bridge: currentTick is a volatile mirror written
once per global tick, and the legacy capture fields are honored only on
the global Server thread while no scoped LevelCaptureContext frame is
active, preserving Paper's single-threaded contract without exposing
region workers to the shared maps.

